{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sLaS5wCFqb1795705889.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國務院總理李強表示，中國會加快釋放超大規模市場需求。</p><p></p><p>李強在北京會見亞洲開發銀行行長神田真人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LI-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aOayN3zaoM1795705875.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李強指今年來，面對外部環境複雜變化，中國經濟頂住壓力穩健前行，為亞洲和世界經濟注入了寶貴的穩定性確定性，中方將繼續推動高質量發展，加快釋放自身超大規模市場需求，促進科技創新和產業創新深度融合，推動經濟持續向新向優向好，為區域發展貢獻力量。</p><p></p><p>神田真人表示，中國經濟展現韌性保持增長，新動能成效顯著，亞行願同中方推動合作夥伴關係邁向更高水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:57.025130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.861016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:18.817577+00:00","content_hash":"07260c3ffdc4d23fac3651cc9cf9aa22403edd779c9d7a1d8cb08d8e500174de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}